### Test Firebase Push Notification Setup

### 1. Test đăng ký device token
POST https://localhost:7000/api/devicetoken/register
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "test-device-token-12345",
  "deviceType": "android",
  "deviceInfo": "{\"model\":\"Samsung Galaxy S21\",\"os\":\"Android 12\",\"appVersion\":\"1.0.0\"}"
}

### 2. Test push notification (Admin only)
POST https://localhost:7000/api/pushnotification/test
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceToken": "test-device-token-12345",
  "title": "Test Push Notification",
  "body": "This is a test message from Health Child Tracker",
  "data": {
    "type": "test",
    "timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:00:00Z"
  }
}

### 3. Test vaccine reminder push
POST https://localhost:7000/api/pushnotification/test-vaccine-reminder
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceToken": "test-device-token-12345",
  "childName": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "vaccineName": "Vaccine BCG",
  "doseNumber": 1,
  "expectedDate": "15/01/2024",
  "facilityName": "Bệnh viện Nhi Đồng 1"
}

### 4. Kiểm tra device tokens của user
GET https://localhost:7000/api/devicetoken/my-tokens
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 5. Check token conflict
POST https://localhost:7000/api/devicetoken/check-conflict
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "test-device-token-12345"
}

### 6. Manual trigger daily vaccine reminders (Admin)
POST https://localhost:7000/api/vaccinereminder/trigger-daily-reminders
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 7. Test gửi push cho tất cả devices của user
POST https://localhost:7000/api/pushnotification/send-to-user
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Thông báo quan trọng",
  "body": "Đây là thông báo gửi đến tất cả thiết bị của bạn",
  "data": {
    "type": "general",
    "priority": "high"
  }
}
